r\n    ├── parseLongFlag() for \"--flag\" style\n    │   ├── Use string.HasPrefix() for matching\n    │   ├── Handle \"--flag value\" (return 2)\n    │   └── Handle \"--flag=value\" (return 1)\n    ├── parseShortFlags() for \"-f\" style\n    │   ├── Process each character in the flag string\n    │   ├── Handle combined flags (-abc)\n    │   └── Return count of args consumed\n    └── Collect remaining args as files\n```\n\n**Key characteristics:**\n- Manually tracking argument consumption with integer returns\n- Support for `--` to end flag processing\n- No external libraries—all custom implementation\n- Consistent error messages (\"option requires an argument\")\n- Both short and long forms where applicable\n\nThis is a Unix utilities style: simple, predictable, no dependencies on Go's flag package."}],"totalDurationMs":13066,"totalTokens":30321,"totalToolUseCount":4,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11496,"cache_read_input_tokens":18037,"output_tokens":782,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11496},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":782,"cache_read_input_tokens":18037,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11496,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11496,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":3,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":1,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
